  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed height and massing of the replacement dwelling would result in an incongruous and bulky addition for the site when viewed from the streetscene and at the rear.&amp;nbsp; The proposals are also considered to result in overdevelopment of the site.&amp;nbsp; As such the proposals are considered to be out of keeping with the character of the site and surrounding Conservation Area and therefore fail to comply with policies set out Chapter 20 of the NPPF,&amp;nbsp; D3 and HC1 of the London Plan 2021 and D12.3 and D12.5 of Merton&#x27;s Local Plan.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed height and massing of the replacement dwelling is considered to have a visually intrusive and overbearing impact for the adjoining neighbour at 43 Marryat Road.&amp;nbsp; As such the proposals are considerd to fail to comply with the policies set out in Chapter 14 of the NPPF,&amp;nbsp; D3 and D6 of the London Plan 2021 and D12.3 of Merton&#x27;s Local Plan.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The information required to ensure the proposed development achieves a high standard of sustainability and makes efficient use of resources was not submitted. As such the proposal is considered to fail to comply with Policy SI 2 and SI 4 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CC2.1 – 2.6 of Merton's Local Plan 2024.&nbsp;"
  ]
